WEBVTT

NOTE The promo is silent; these cues carry its on-screen text.

00:00.400 --> 00:03.500
Declare: code, docs, design, images. All Artifacts.

00:03.800 --> 00:06.600
Verify: Runtime, Agent and Human evals. One layer.

00:06.600 --> 00:08.700
Five evals, all GREEN.

00:09.300 --> 00:12.600
Collaborate: build apart, verify apart.

00:12.600 --> 00:15.200
Each branch executes 3 evals and reuses 2.

00:16.200 --> 00:18.000
Reuse: still-valid reviews are reused. Pay only for what changed.

00:18.000 --> 00:20.600
After the merge: 4 reused, 0 Agent tokens, 0 Human sign-offs, 1 executed.

00:21.600 --> 00:24.100
Artifactize. Declare. Verify. Reuse.

00:24.100 --> 00:27.400
artifactize.dev. Not just code: manage every artifact together.
